{"id":"acdebd9205e00668","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-five-lemma.md","title":"Five Lemma","display":"thm-five-lemma — Five Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-five-lemma","aliases":["58-thm-five-lemma"],"display":"thm-five-lemma — Five Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-five-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-five-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-five-lemma — Five Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"58-df-injective.md\">58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in V\">\\(R\\in V\\)</span> (scalar-ring carrier with one shared ring structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B:5\\to V\">\\(A,B:5\\to V\\)</span> (the five module carriers in the upper and lower rows)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b:4\\to V\">\\(a,b:4\\to V\\)</span> (the four horizontal homomorphisms in the two rows)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:5\\to V\">\\(u:5\\to V\\)</span> (the five vertical homomorphisms)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_A,0_A,\\odot_A,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\">\\(+_A,0_A,\\odot_A,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\\)</span> are five-term families of module operations, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\">\\(+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\)</span> are shared by all ten modules.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> is the fully structured left-module predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (set-map predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}five\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,4,\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,4,\\operatorname{ran}(b))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,5,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_A,0_A,\\odot_A,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(+_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(+_A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(0_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(0_A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(\\odot_A))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(+_B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(0_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(0_B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(\\odot_B))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in5\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(A(i),R,+_A(i),0_A(i),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{44mm}\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B(i),R,+_B(i),0_B(i),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B(i))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in4\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(a(i),A(i),A(i+1))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b(i),B(i),B(i+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in A(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\na(i)(+_A(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_A(i+1)(\\langle a(i)(x),a(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land a(i)(\\odot_A(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_A(i+1)(\\langle r,a(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in B(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nb(i)(+_B(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_B(i+1)(\\langle b(i)(x),b(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land b(i)(\\odot_B(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_B(i+1)(\\langle r,b(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in5\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(u(i),A(i),B(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in A(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nu(i)(+_A(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_B(i)(\\langle u(i)(x),u(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land u(i)(\\odot_A(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_B(i)(\\langle r,u(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall x\\in A(i)\\;\\bigl(a(i)(x)=0_A(i+1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in A(i-1)\\;(a(i-1)(y)=x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall x\\in B(i)\\;\\bigl(b(i)(x)=0_B(i+1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in B(i-1)\\;(b(i-1)(y)=x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in4\\;\\bigl(u(i+1)\\circ a(i)=b(i)\\circ u(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(u(0),A(0),B(0))\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(1),A(1),B(1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(3),A(3),B(3))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(u(4),A(4),B(4))\n\\to\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(2),A(2),B(2)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}five\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,4,\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,4,\\operatorname{ran}(b))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,5,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_A,0_A,\\odot_A,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(+_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(+_A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(0_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(0_A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(\\odot_A))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(+_B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(0_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(0_B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(\\odot_B))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in5\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(A(i),R,+_A(i),0_A(i),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{44mm}\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B(i),R,+_B(i),0_B(i),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B(i))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in4\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(a(i),A(i),A(i+1))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b(i),B(i),B(i+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in A(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\na(i)(+_A(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_A(i+1)(\\langle a(i)(x),a(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land a(i)(\\odot_A(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_A(i+1)(\\langle r,a(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in B(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nb(i)(+_B(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_B(i+1)(\\langle b(i)(x),b(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land b(i)(\\odot_B(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_B(i+1)(\\langle r,b(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in5\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(u(i),A(i),B(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in A(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nu(i)(+_A(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_B(i)(\\langle u(i)(x),u(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land u(i)(\\odot_A(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_B(i)(\\langle r,u(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall x\\in A(i)\\;\\bigl(a(i)(x)=0_A(i+1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in A(i-1)\\;(a(i-1)(y)=x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall x\\in B(i)\\;\\bigl(b(i)(x)=0_B(i+1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in B(i-1)\\;(b(i-1)(y)=x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in4\\;\\bigl(u(i+1)\\circ a(i)=b(i)\\circ u(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(u(0),A(0),B(0))\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(1),A(1),B(1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(3),A(3),B(3))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(u(4),A(4),B(4))\n\\to\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(2),A(2),B(2)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the standard five lemma in the abelian category of left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-modules: the outer vertical maps are respectively epic and monic, while the adjacent two are isomorphisms.</li>\n<li>All ten modules use one displayed ring structure, and every homomorphism and exactness clause uses the same indexed module operations. Thus the rows and vertical maps cannot silently choose incompatible structures on equal carriers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ is the fully structured left-module predicate from [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A,B:5\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"a,b:4\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"u:5\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"+_A,0_A,\\odot_A,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B","display":false},{"tex":"+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Surjective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}five\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,4,\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,4,\\operatorname{ran}(b))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,5,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_A,0_A,\\odot_A,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(+_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(+_A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(0_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(0_A))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_A,5,\\operatorname{ran}(\\odot_A))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(+_B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(0_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(0_B))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_B,5,\\operatorname{ran}(\\odot_B))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in5\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(A(i),R,+_A(i),0_A(i),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A(i))\\\\\n&\\hspace{44mm}\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B(i),R,+_B(i),0_B(i),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B(i))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in4\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(a(i),A(i),A(i+1))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b(i),B(i),B(i+1))\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in A(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\na(i)(+_A(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_A(i+1)(\\langle a(i)(x),a(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{58mm}\\land a(i)(\\odot_A(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_A(i+1)(\\langle r,a(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in B(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nb(i)(+_B(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_B(i+1)(\\langle b(i)(x),b(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{58mm}\\land b(i)(\\odot_B(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_B(i+1)(\\langle r,b(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in5\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(u(i),A(i),B(i))\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in A(i)\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nu(i)(+_A(i)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_B(i)(\\langle u(i)(x),u(i)(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{58mm}\\land u(i)(\\odot_A(i)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))\n=\\odot_B(i)(\\langle r,u(i)(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall x\\in A(i)\\;\\bigl(a(i)(x)=0_A(i+1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in A(i-1)\\;(a(i-1)(y)=x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall x\\in B(i)\\;\\bigl(b(i)(x)=0_B(i+1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in B(i-1)\\;(b(i-1)(y)=x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in4\\;\\bigl(u(i+1)\\circ a(i)=b(i)\\circ u(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(u(0),A(0),B(0))\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(1),A(1),B(1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(3),A(3),B(3))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(u(4),A(4),B(4))\n\\to\\mathrm{Bijective}(u(2),A(2),B(2)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":3935,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-five-lemma.md|58-thm-five-lemma]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["ef3a5dd6825f0373","36d7463d215be751","8317eefb4572709e","9f8cb046321ba311","d583890235faf0d5"]}